{"id":2717,"date":"2025-08-01T13:32:50","date_gmt":"2025-08-01T18:32:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2717"},"modified":"2025-08-01T13:32:50","modified_gmt":"2025-08-01T18:32:50","slug":"terra-antarctica","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/terra-antarctica\/","title":{"rendered":"Terra Antarctica"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"h-arkham-horror-the-roleplaying-game\">Arkham Horror &#8211; The Roleplaying Game<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"h-premium-adventure\">Premium Adventure<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"h-terra-antarctica\">Terra Antarctica<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><em>In 1930, the great Miskatonic Expedition to the Antarctic ended in tragedy. Twelve of its members died in the shadows of the largest mountain range ever discovered, and several more su\u00adffered deep mental scars \u2011 om the experience.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Two years later, a new team of scientists announced their own expedition. But as they suddenly vanish too, the world is left in shock. Only a team of skilled investigators can be brave enough to return to those mountains of madness. But will they save the lost explorers? Or are they also fated never to return?<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-ZuJgye wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"container simple-width relative max-w-[800px] w-full mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/background_thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center rotate-3\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"absolute w-full z-10 thumbnail_news\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; transform: rotate(1deg);\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/07\/Terra-Antarctica_simple-width.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>Over 50\u00ad hours of exploration, adventure, dazzling action, and heroic battles await you within Terra Antarctica. This premium adventure boxed set contains all the material you need to deeply immerse yourself into an epic campaign. Players can take on the role of one of six premade characters or use their own characters from the <strong><em>Arkham Horror RPG Core Rulebook<\/em><\/strong>. In either case, this campaign provides unique options for advancement, a full roster of equipment, and redoubtable allies to help the expedition succeed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>To run this game, you\u2019ll need a copy of the <strong><em>Arkham Horror RPG Core Rulebook<\/em><\/strong> or a copy of the <strong><em>Starter Set<\/em><\/strong> and a few additional six-sided dice.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-Z2rw6lo wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"simple-height relative w-full flex justify-center items-center px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative mx-auto w-[85%] md:w-[35%]\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/bg_header_height.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/thumbnail_true.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute z-10 thumbnail_news w-[90%]\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(1deg); top: 20px; left: 20px;\">\n\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/07\/Terra-Antarctica_simple-height.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/news\/tape.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute max-w-[150px] object-cover z-20\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(70deg); left: 30%; top: -45px;\"\/>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>This box contains 3 48-page books, 3 double-sided poster maps, 6 investigator portfolios, 24 six-sided dice, 1 expedition journal (16 pages), 1 expedition inventory sheet, 1 expedition roster, 48 item cards, 30 adversary and ally profile cards, 2 puzzles, and more than 100 tokens.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-ZicmnM wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"simple-dual-image relative max-w-full mt-10 md:mt-0 mx-auto\"\n             style=\"width: 90%; max-width: 620px;\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/dual-image\/backthumbnail.png\"\n  